{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 27 for iOS 27, Liquid Glass is forced by the system and considered as enabled by OUDS.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 26 for iOS 26, the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" flag is read and OUDS considers wether or not Liquid Glass is enabled.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 26 for iOS 18 and lower, Liquid Glass is considered as unavailable, disabled.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The edge case is when the OS version is 27, the flag "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" stils exists but the app is compiled with Xcode 26.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This case is extreme: the system does not force Liquid Glass, the flag is here, and OUDS cannot only rely on the OS version.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Thus, this ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"  will define an environment value saying any legacy layout things (appearances, selector, divider) must be displayed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"**You must use this "},{"code":"ViewModifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with care, and only if you are using Xcode 26 and  "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" to YES **."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Prefer build with Xcode 27 without the "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":"  flag."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["  OUDSTabBar(selectedTab: ..., count: ...) { ... )","    .modifier(OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier())"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Note: You should use this view modifier in your root view because the flag it defines in deeper levels is used for all navigations components like bars","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"3.0.0","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Since"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier"}],"symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents24OUDSLegacyLayoutModifierV","role":"symbol","title":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","roleHeading":"Structure"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslegacylayoutmodifier"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier\/init()"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier\/body(content:)"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier\/ViewModifier-Implementations"],"generated":true}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP"]}],"abstract":[{"code":"ViewModifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to manage an edge case about Liquid Glass configuration of Apple OS and Xcode versions.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier"},"references":{"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifier"},{"type":"text","text":" to manage an edge case about Liquid Glass configuration of Apple OS and Xcode versions."}],"title":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslegacylayoutmodifier","type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier/body(content:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"body","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"content","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14OUDSComponents24OUDSLegacyLayoutModifierV"},{"text":".","kind":"tex